{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641050","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1064105001:1":{"text":"……讲到这里，阿塔利娅大人降临我们恩莎村的故事就结束了。","source_cn":"……讲到这里，阿塔利娅大人降临我们恩莎村的故事就结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9262610883522F82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064105002:1":{"text":"阿塔利娅大人真是一位又善良又厉害的半神呀……","source_cn":"阿塔利娅大人真是一位又善良又厉害的半神呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF553F78994A90EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064105003:1":{"text":"对了，路易莎奶奶，艾达修女后来去哪了？她好像不在我们村子里。","source_cn":"对了，路易莎奶奶，艾达修女后来去哪了？她好像不在我们村子里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7091A347CA331DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064105004:1":{"text":"艾达修女呀……她加入了阿塔利娅大人治下的执刃修女团，作为最受阿塔利娅大人信任的准绳，活跃至今。","source_cn":"艾达修女呀……她加入了阿塔利娅大人治下的执刃修女团，作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601B6070BD9BB693","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064105005:1":{"text":"前段时间她还有写信回来，说她们协助阿塔利娅大人破坏了一群恶徒的阴谋。","source_cn":"前段时间她还有写信回来，说她们协助阿塔利娅大人破坏了一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CEC670D8B81B1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064105006:1":{"text":"哇！好厉害！路易莎奶奶可以给我讲这个故事吗？","source_cn":"哇！好厉害！路易莎奶奶可以给我讲这个故事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF76C013DA5B0E865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064105007:1":{"text":"当然可以。不过现在，你得回家了，你爸爸已经来接你了。","source_cn":"当然可以。不过现在，你得回家了，你爸爸已经来接你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59D10F67B8C8DB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064105008:0":{"text":"小安娜，该回家了，不要总是给路易莎奶奶添麻烦。","source_cn":"小安娜，该回家了，不要总是给路易莎奶奶添麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9648513DC09645E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064105009:0":{"text":"呵呵，没这回事。小安娜一向很听话。","source_cn":"呵呵，没这回事。小安娜一向很听话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35356445C1E5DCCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064105010:1":{"text":"就是就是，我可乖了！","source_cn":"就是就是，我可乖了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F2FEFEDCDDE4970","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064105011:1":{"text":"那就好。","source_cn":"那就好。","status"